                "We should assign a tracker to TableReaderExecutor and attach it to IndexLookup, and TableReader tracks the memory usage itself.",
                "The `func (e *TableReaderExecutor) Open` will be reset `memTracker` and attached to session tracker. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/pingcap/tidb/blob/c1cae24a87792055e96a213afc9f1459a183b767/pkg/executor/table_reader.go#L143-L156\r\n\r\nIn `func (w *tableWorker) executeTask` https://github.com/pingcap/tidb/blob/c1cae24a87792055e96a213afc9f1459a183b767/pkg/executor/distsql.go#L1452, `tableReader` is created but there is nowhere to invoke `Open`. Such redicurious situation make it hard to assign a tracker to  `tableReader` .\r\n\r\n"
